{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"grand_kitchen","model_identifier":"grand_kitchen","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# grand_kitchen\n\nGrand kitchen (tier 5): a long stone hall with three chimneys, two brick bread ovens and a row of hanging hams.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 7 columns (192 x 112 units, 5.40 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -86..103, y 0..152, z -46..46 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 87, construction_0 29, construction_33 41, construction_66 58, ruined 39 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 186 x 140 x 76 centred at x 11, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `grand_kitchen_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `grand_kitchen_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_grand_kitchen` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -41)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-40, 153, 2)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (0, 153, 2)\n- `fx_smoke_3` at (40, 153, 2)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"k_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-82.0,0.0,-34.0],"to":[82.0,3.0,38.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[172.0,330.0,336.0,333.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[176.0,333.0,248.0,336.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[172.0,330.0,336.0,333.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[176.0,333.0,248.0,336.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[295.0,0.0,459.0,72.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[295.0,0.0,459.0,72.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"19fdb7f0-2cd0-5f13-be33-6cfa4dc365ca"},{"name":"k_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-80.0,3.0,-32.0],"to":[80.0,95.0,-28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,178.0,92.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[238.0,0.0,242.0,92.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,178.0,92.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[238.0,0.0,242.0,92.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,326.0,160.0,330.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,326.0,160.0,330.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b045e523-5e9b-57be-ba8d-fba2eec0e707"},{"name":"k_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-80.0,3.0,32.0],"to":[80.0,95.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,178.0,92.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[238.0,0.0,242.0,92.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,178.0,92.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[238.0,0.0,242.0,92.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,326.0,160.0,330.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,326.0,160.0,330.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube"